   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Serbi?&#x2019;s EU Accession Negotiations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support institutional capacities for the EU accession negotiations process. In particular, the project will strengthen the Ministry of European Integration for efficient implementation of the revised enlargement methodology and creation and implementation of the plan for full membership by 2030.</narrative>
