      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roadmap on the functioning of democratic institutions</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">By finalisation of the Roadmap on the functioning of democratic institutions and formulation of plans for accelerated integration and &#x201c;phasing in&#x201d;. Plan for accelerated integration and phasing will be made in correlation with obligations stemming from negotiations framework and NPAA.</narrative>
    </description>
